    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 7,
        "sourceEnd": 61,
        "text": "What does your model of the school playground predict?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "9b72c67792618357b78e5a2db42da89c778927b253d9bded1a46aa5595e02f62",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "ana",
        "speaker": "Ana",
        "sourceStart": 67,
        "sourceEnd": 191,
        "text": "How quickly a shallow pool drains through different surfaces. I tested gravel, paving and compacted soil in identical trays.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "de836fe38dd1ee4f2abd4870c1a728bb24c7bc081405206f792f4661dced9e74",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 199,
        "sourceEnd": 228,
        "text": "Were the water volumes equal?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "54b5ea9c2f86b8da2230eed1105e0646357ac982ab5059f6436495d986e2fc73",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ana",
        "speaker": "Ana",
        "sourceStart": 234,
        "sourceEnd": 345,
        "text": "Yes, two litres per tray. I first planned one litre, but the pool disappeared too quickly to time consistently.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "7ca380a7c80944973e76a5549b5d25995985f697b719bf4fcfa02bd560dfaf05",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 353,
        "sourceEnd": 378,
        "text": "What was the main result?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "c9fca474ee9bc42cfe173f241f368695bb28bd7eb54588f1d400fdd4cebe5cb0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ana",
        "speaker": "Ana",
        "sourceStart": 384,
        "sourceEnd": 547,
        "text": "The gravel tray drained fastest. That does not prove gravel is the best surface for the whole playground, because we did not test wheelchair access or maintenance.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "04353a05159d51aed529ec41456c1f8ba43bae5d11058a52234cb4129fe722fc",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 555,
        "sourceEnd": 601,
        "text": "What other limitation should the report state?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "3625eccb1302fccb6ba7e6e790a839397b0f4b9bec346878efc3c1583b937c85",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ana",
        "speaker": "Ana",
        "sourceStart": 607,
        "sourceEnd": 713,
        "text": "The trays had no slope. The real site slopes towards the entrance, so water may collect differently there.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "50d01b6d021a90c6be67a3f10f6dcf0ef77f032c9695eea805469c0694b17998",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 721,
        "sourceEnd": 765,
        "text": "How many times did you repeat the procedure?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "638e65ce81c9121de8dcaa3466da806e01634541a70413c78d073b2049b3d825",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ana",
        "speaker": "Ana",
        "sourceStart": 771,
        "sourceEnd": 898,
        "text": "Five times for each material, using the same pouring height. I kept the slowest result rather than removing it as inconvenient.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "230f4a8256748c60f5abffc408a5e38344e1d982561f9f9d51f7479ab72569cd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 906,
        "sourceEnd": 936,
        "text": "Was that a faulty measurement?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "c8a2d3584481c5e5a04903347dcc5fe1632e4542630873da01bee3c5d8c1acd6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ana",
        "speaker": "Ana",
        "sourceStart": 942,
        "sourceEnd": 1094,
        "text": "We do not know. The video shows a brief blockage near the outlet. I will describe it and show the results with and without that trial, clearly labelled.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "f696d6e22496c3859dd935b90bdc9fb2b162c19f1d2c3138bb3dd200abdd41ea",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 1102,
        "sourceEnd": 1120,
        "text": "What happens next?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "c72895ba705e0802ce458857f0d4239190e7e19756e11e32ff3d045f5f5a9a8c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ana",
        "speaker": "Ana",
        "sourceStart": 1126,
        "sourceEnd": 1242,
        "text": "A site visit on Friday to measure the slope. Our present recommendation is another test, not immediate construction.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "29ba2e6904175dbd7d098263ea6cb1e49ee0fe4a75542c91f2a7a61a29e92141",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
